URL:https://bethisraelnc.org/events/cafe-israel-israeli-food-music-films-d
 ancing-and-more/
SUMMARY:Cafe Israel - Israeli food\, music\, films\, dancing and more!
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Sunday\, April 30th to celebrate Israel’s 75th bir
 thday with another energetic cultural immersion into Israeli food\, music 
 and dance.\n\n\n 	Traditional recipes with a vegan/vegetarian twist\;\n 	L
 ive Israeli &amp\; Hebrew music with O–vadya\;\n 	Family fun with inflat
 ables and balloon twisting\;\n 	Performances by Israeli Folk Dance\, Charl
 otte\;\n 	Israeli films and community booths\; and\n 	Silent auction treas
 ures from local artists and businesses.\n\nThis year’s celebration is de
 dicated to Hanan Weizman (z”l)\, beloved CBI member and founder of our f
 estival.\n\n\nRegistrants of the Jewish Community Center’s Falafel 5K\, 
 our sister event\, receive a free falafel sandwich at Cafe Israel followin
 g the athletic event’s conclusion.\n\nOur generous sponsors:\n\n\n\n&nbs
 p\;\n\nTheodor Herzl Sponsors:\n\n 	Wendy Feinberg\n 	Jonas &amp\; Meryl G
 oldstein\n 	Helene &amp\; Saul Nathanson\n 	Alan Nichol &amp\; Barb Lebovi
 tz\n 	William &amp\; Barbara Lewin\n 	Nest Realty – Natalie Kramer Shaw\
 n 	Mike Weizman &amp\; Della Simon\n 	Caren Kessler\n 	Bob &amp\; Leslie G
 oldstein\n 	Mary Rubin\n\nBen Gurion Sponsors:\n\n 	Lee Avishai\n 	Charles
  Griggs\n 	Barbara Lebovitz\n\nGolda Meir Sponsors:\n\n 	Carol Cohen\n 	In
 gles\n 	Fresh Market\n 	Harris Teeter\n 	Trader Joes\n 	Green Live/Whole F
 oods\n 	Walmart\n 	Sam’s Club\n 	SavMor\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://bethisraelnc.org/wp-content/uploads/2023
 /04/Cafe-Israel-Logo-2023.jpg
CATEGORIES:Community Event
END:VEVENT
