URL:https://bethisraelnc.org/events/one-light-brunch-gala-honoring-caren-k
 essler-jay-marlene-jacoby/
SUMMARY:One Light - Brunch Gala Honoring Caren Kessler\, Jay & Marlene Jaco
 by
DESCRIPTION:We hope that you can join us for a festive brunch and celebrati
 on honoring beloved congregants Caren Kessler and Jay &amp\; Marlene Jacob
 y for their extraordinary contributions to Congregation Beth Israel and th
 e community.\n\nOne Light tickets are $54\n\nFor a 100-character message i
 n the Tribute book* ($75)\n\nFor a 1/4 page message/ad in the Tribute Book
 * ($150)\n\nAny of the above options can be seen and ordered here.\n\n*Pl
 ease send the text of your message or ads\, and any graphics to director@b
 ethisraelnc.org by the print deadline\, Monday\, May 1.\n\nIf you would l
 ike to sponsor the event\, sponsorship opportunities are in the link below
 .\n\nOne Light Sponsorship Opportunities 2023\n\nOne Light Invitation
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://bethisraelnc.org/wp-content/uploads/2023
 /04/One-Light-flower.png
CATEGORIES:Community Event
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Congregation Beth Israel
UID:265@bethisraelnc.org
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230528T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20230528T173000
DTSTAMP:20230427T143318Z
URL:https://bethisraelnc.org/events/torah-on-tap/
SUMMARY:Torah on Tap
DESCRIPTION:Bitcoin\, Dogecoin\, Ethereum…. there are now hundreds of cry
 ptocurrencies available online (and\, yes\, a few cryptocurrency managers 
 heading to jail). So\, what’s all the fuss? How  does it work? Is crypt
 o on the up and up or is it just another get-rich-quick  scam?\n\nJoin us
  this Sunday as we try to explain and understand what the heck cryptocurre
 ncy is and whether it’s kosher or not.\n\nNote: Change of Venue: This m
 onth\, we will be meeting at the Biltmore Park Clubhouse\, 1067 Columbine 
 Road\, 28803. Thanks to Steve and Carol Kayne for coordinating. Feel free 
 to BYOB (bring your own beverage/beer). Sorry\, no BYOD (your own dog).
CATEGORIES:Community Event
LOCATION:Biltmore Clubhouse\, 1067 Columbine Road\, Asheville\, NC\, 28803\
 , United States
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=1067 Columbine Road\, Ashev
 ille\, NC\, 28803\, United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Biltmore Club
 house:geo:0,0
END:VEVENT
