URL:https://bethisraelnc.org/events/cbi-3rd-annual-golf-classic-at-cumming
 s-cove-golf-and-country-club/
SUMMARY:CBI 3rd Annual Golf Classic at Cummings Cove Golf and Country Club
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to the 3rd Annual CBI Golf Tournament.  We have rename
 d the event to be called the Greater Asheville Mountain Invitational Golf 
 Tournament.  This year\, we are introducing a 2nd beneficiary of the fund
 raiser\, local non-profit Homeward Bound.\n\nWe’ll be hitting the green 
 at Cummings Cove in Hendersonville on Friday June 16th.  Breakfast and re
 gistration will open at 9am\, with the scramble start at 10am.  We hope t
 o see you there!\n\nClick here for registration.\n\nSponsorship Informatio
 n (benefitting Beth Israel &amp\; Homeward Bound) below.\n\n\nCBI Golf Cla
 ssic Sponsorship Opportunities\n\nThank you for considering a sponsorship 
 of our upcoming golf tournament. This fundraiser will also benefit Homewar
 d Bound and is a wonderful way to support our community\, raise brand awar
 eness AND have some fun!\n\n$1\,500 Presenting Eagle Sponsorship (includes
  two foursomes in the tournament)\nLogo as Presenting sponsor on all tourn
 ament materials\nParticipants will get raffle tickets and mulligans\nTee S
 ign with your logo\nOpportunity to include promotional materials in regist
 ration packet\nFour additional Guests for Lunch &amp\; Awards\n\n$1\,000 B
 irdie Sponsorship (includes one foursome in the tournament)\nParticipants 
 will get raffle tickets and mulligans\nListed as a sponsor on all tourname
 nt materials\nTee Sign with your logo\nOpportunity to include promotional 
 materials in registration packet\n\n$500 Auction Sponsor\nYour logo on eac
 h auction bid sheet\nListed as a sponsor on all tournament materials\nTee 
 Sign with your logo\nOpportunity to include promotional materials in regis
 tration packet\n\n$250 Mulligan Sponsorship\nYour logo on the Mulligan Cer
 tificates\n\n$100 Tee Sponsor\nTee Sign with your Logo\n\nPlease contact R
 ochelle Reich to indicate your interest - director@bethisraelnc.org.\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://bethisraelnc.org/wp-content/uploads/2023
 /04/CummingsCoveMMG.jpg
CATEGORIES:Community Event
END:VEVENT
